<ArticleTitle>mRNA vaccine <i>immunogenicity</i> in adults.</ArticleTitle>
<Abstract>
<AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">mRNA vaccines have shown strong efficacy against respiratory viruses in large randomized trials across many populations worldwide.</AbstractText>
<AbstractText Label="METHODS">We conducted a phase 3 randomized observer-blinded placebo-controlled trial enrolling adults and measured neutralizing antibody titers.</AbstractText>
<AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Seroconversion occurred in the vast majority of participants and reactogenicity was mostly mild to moderate in severity.</AbstractText>
</Abstract>
